[{"y": 0.06828488372065875, "h": 0.027819767790150506, "w": 0.05724508073594835, "text": "5.2", "x": 0.11091234344240149}, {"h": 0.01896802322098501, "y": 0.04046511635971098, "x": 0.22182468275175654, "w": 0.17173524644639754, "text": "GRAMMAR"}, {"y": 0.08219476775072078, "h": 0.01138081348329678, "text": "must/mustn't", "x": 0.22182468647793593, "w": 0.1019677988688151}, {"x": 0.21824686826663456, "text": "• should/shouldn't", "h": 0.01146755085525103, "y": 0.09610465134519754, "w": 0.14490161471896698}, {"y": 0.1530087211021016, "x": 0.10375671464087595, "w": 0.20930231730143228, "h": 0.011490376499155346, "text": "SHOW WHAT YOU KNOW"}, {"text": "1 Complete the text with the correct form of have to", "h": 0.011526897005225837, "x": 0.1001788986352291, "w": 0.38461537679036456, "y": 0.17941787013831212}, {"w": 0.18962432861328127, "y": 0.19347383741827634, "x": 0.11449016364505875, "h": 0.010285187817652787, "text": "and the verbs in brackets."}, {"y": 0.2307313521969743, "text": "Hi Jo,", "w": 0.03885613759358725, "x": 0.123782804113756, "h": 0.014017830574985743}, {"x": 0.12343471457484491, "text": "I have to make (make) a decision about next year.", "w": 0.3345259263780382, "y": 0.2465523464849867, "h": 0.012677304366005072}, {"y": 0.2591155235000875, "w": 0.34347049289279513, "h": 0.01149494132840683, "x": 0.12522361151424644, "text": "I can stay here or go to the same *sixth form college"}, {"y": 0.2731395350808807, "w": 0.23076922946506073, "text": "as you. So, I've got a few questions.", "x": 0.12522361655548392, "h": 0.011494941328406732}, {"h": 0.012645348314774242, "text": "Firstly,", "x": 0.12343470405074476, "y": 0.2870494189164501, "w": 0.0536672634548611}, {"x": 0.3202146737614291, "text": "(you/wear) a uniform?", "w": 0.14132378472222223, "h": 0.012704694839160775, "y": 0.28699007218341516}, {"x": 0.1252236122884697, "h": 0.01028518781765269, "y": 0.3022238374815031, "w": 0.18962432861328124, "text": "Sixth formers at our school 2"}, {"y": 0.3160424184577658, "x": 0.12343471136270062, "h": 0.0127366508903917, "text": "(not/wear) a uniform but they 3", "w": 0.20930231730143228}, {"text": "(look) smart - they can't wear jeans, for example.", "x": 0.16100179914090645, "y": 0.3313081396696478, "w": 0.31127010769314234, "h": 0.012645348314774242}, {"y": 0.34901162799981233, "text": "Next question, how much homework *", "x": 0.12522361763284423, "h": 0.011394509094286501, "w": 0.24508049858940972}, {"text": "(you/do) every day? A friend who is a year", "y": 0.3641860467096188, "x": 0.18783542940190728, "w": 0.27906975640190973, "h": 0.012709260417235902}, {"h": 0.010207581227436775, "y": 0.378073104696465, "text": "older than me here 5", "x": 0.12522361529198847, "w": 0.13595706515842013}, {"y": 0.3793604652620264, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "text": "(do)", "x": 0.4114490166539453, "w": 0.033989266289605025}, {"w": 0.2933810424804687, "x": 0.1252236106023417, "h": 0.01148581092108022, "text": "about three hours of homework a day but he", "y": 0.3906362816773995}, {"x": 0.28622540175832695, "text": "(not/do) anything at the", "y": 0.4059156974134725, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "w": 0.16279069688585068}, {"x": 0.1252236157690119, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "y": 0.42109011653019507, "w": 0.06261180453830295, "text": "weekend."}, {"w": 0.15921288384331594, "x": 0.12343470497011298, "y": 0.43879360481820845, "text": "I think that's all for now.", "h": 0.008851743820341854}, {"h": 0.012645348314774147, "w": 0.05545616997612847, "text": "Thanks,", "x": 0.12164579763715937, "y": 0.4514389537495896}, {"x": 0.12164579653319388, "y": 0.4640843024839741, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "w": 0.03398926628960505, "text": "Seth"}, {"y": 0.4956976745959653, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "w": 0.35599283854166663, "text": "* Sixth form college - the last years in the British school system.", "x": 0.1234347121915995}, {"x": 0.12343470875793697, "text": "Students aged 16-18 stay in the sixth form for two years while", "y": 0.5070784885075252, "h": 0.008851743820341951, "w": 0.35062611897786455}, {"y": 0.5184593025029421, "x": 0.12343472091982821, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "text": "they study for A levels, the highest level of school exams.", "w": 0.3166368272569444}, {"text": "* Read the dialogue between Cathy and Damien and", "y": 0.5512093864266855, "w": 0.37030412462022566, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "x": 0.11091234105048}, {"y": 0.5652470934425401, "h": 0.012659043551352046, "text": "choose the correct option.", "w": 0.18246868557400173, "x": 0.11091234916290962}, {"text": "C: I'm not sure I want to be in the school play.", "h": 0.01303225803030959, "w": 0.32218451605902776, "x": 0.11082758891056885, "y": 0.5853249344166668}, {"x": 0.11091234009365578, "h": 0.012672739536753685, "text": "D: Well, you 'don't have to / mustn't be in it. It's your", "y": 0.5993895349341827, "w": 0.35062611897786455}, {"text": "choice but it's great fun. Of course, it takes a lot of time.", "x": 0.1341681716528421, "h": 0.012704694839160775, "w": 0.3667262776692708, "y": 0.6132400723414821}, {"w": 0.37030409071180553, "text": "People who want to be in the play 2must / mustn't go to", "x": 0.13237926164320274, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "y": 0.6272093020646353}, {"w": 0.35599283854166663, "x": 0.13237925453656077, "y": 0.6422924185736814, "text": "Drama Club every Tuesday and Thursday after school.", "h": 0.0127366508903917}, {"text": "They 3don't have to / must learn their words and they", "w": 0.35062611897786455, "h": 0.012695565180658001, "x": 0.13416816047528946, "y": 0.656293604861799}, {"w": 0.3579172092013889, "h": 0.011666273313308875, "text": "'mustn't / don't have to be late because everyone has", "x": 0.13052183909948087, "y": 0.6701627346644358}, {"w": 0.36851518419053814, "x": 0.13237925966382452, "text": "to wait for them. Of course, you mustn't / don't have to", "y": 0.6841133725649966, "h": 0.012750346126969504}, {"text": "act. You can help with the music or the clothes.", "y": 0.6992193139799815, "w": 0.30769229465060766, "h": 0.011449290415009824, "x": 0.13237926030737343}, {"w": 0.33452592637803824, "h": 0.01154059224180364, "text": "C: What do you think? / should / Should I do it?", "x": 0.1109123483852206, "y": 0.7131976747675086}, {"y": 0.7258430233589647, "text": "D: Of course. I think it's a great idea. You must / don't", "x": 0.11091234418705577, "w": 0.3756708441840278, "h": 0.012645348314774147}, {"text": "have to see Ms Lee at lunchtime and tell her.", "x": 0.13237925825609143, "y": 0.7408348376417373, "w": 0.30769229465060766, "h": 0.01029888305423059}, {"x": 0.1323792577645889, "text": "She needs the list of names today.", "y": 0.7549273258375666, "w": 0.23792485555013018, "h": 0.011426464771105508}, {"x": 0.5348837208472978, "text": "3", "h": 0.008851743820341854, "w": 0.010733452902899843, "y": 0.05816860492253256}, {"text": "* * Complete Cathy's email with the correct", "x": 0.5563506347227773, "y": 0.056904069617142575, "w": 0.33273701985677084, "h": 0.013909883895075253}, {"text": "answers A-C.", "h": 0.010116278651819317, "x": 0.5581395384944642, "y": 0.07207848858106712, "w": 0.09838997734917532}, {"w": 0.012522361543443439, "x": 0.5313059034635198, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "text": "4", "y": 0.34774709316900315}, {"x": 0.5420393569976245, "y": 0.09736462060320063, "text": "Hi Sally,", "h": 0.012649913892849272, "w": 0.055456169976128455}, {"x": 0.5420393586400488, "y": 0.10992779766000717, "w": 0.3828264702690972, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "text": "Well, I'm in the school play! I'_ say much. I come on in the"}, {"y": 0.12392441880264199, "w": 0.3899820963541667, "h": 0.012700130009909388, "x": 0.5420393665217836, "text": "middle of the play and say: 'Excuse me, is this the way to the"}, {"h": 0.013909883895075253, "text": "forest?' and that's it! The first meeting is tomorrow. We?", "x": 0.5402504591844955, "y": 0.1365697672156891, "w": 0.3649373711480034}, {"x": 0.9141323797397511, "y": 0.1378343026188578, "text": "be", "w": 0.026833629608154275, "h": 0.010116278651819317}, {"x": 0.5402504522524635, "w": 0.23434704250759542, "y": 0.1503655234659211, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "text": "late. Ms Lee says that a good actor?"}, {"w": 0.15742396036783846, "x": 0.7763864084028429, "h": 0.012754910956220987, "y": 0.15174418643418264, "text": "_ be well organised and"}, {"h": 0.012672739536753588, "y": 0.16438953507267937, "text": "brave. That's why, in the first meeting, we all have to stand", "w": 0.37567084418402774, "x": 0.5420393569777535}, {"text": "in front of the group and say some lines from a play. Luckily,", "y": 0.17703488393999667, "w": 0.3881931898328993, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "x": 0.5402504566190303}, {"h": 0.012700130009909388, "y": 0.18962545120852425, "w": 0.37745975070529514, "x": 0.5420393491255876, "text": "we* sing!!\" find something that | know well - maybe"}, {"y": 0.20359011654028739, "w": 0.40071556939019104, "text": "something from Romeo and Juliet. I'm studying that in English.", "h": 0.012732085312316574, "x": 0.540250449294171}, {"w": 0.24329159206814244, "y": 0.21623546501339985, "x": 0.5402504502986658, "text": "Anyway, 1°_ do my homework now.", "h": 0.013909883895075253}, {"x": 0.5419663190155163, "w": 0.09316932678222656, "h": 0.011992712894501736, "y": 0.23110393388335965, "text": "See you soon."}, {"text": "Cathy", "y": 0.24279069785682542, "x": 0.5402504479491849, "w": 0.041144900851779465, "h": 0.01138081348329678}, {"y": 0.26302325619153216, "w": 0.09481216430664063, "h": 0.010225841293266157, "text": "1 A mustn't", "x": 0.5563506257476933}, {"x": 0.710196782224796, "w": 0.08407870822482633, "text": "B shouldn't", "h": 0.01266817395867856, "y": 0.26175872103338327}, {"x": 0.8354203933247557, "text": "C don't have te", "y": 0.2617587210127531, "w": 0.10912343343098962, "h": 0.010116278651819317}, {"y": 0.2756046930899359, "w": 0.1359570651584201, "h": 0.010207581227436775, "x": 0.5563506288996212, "text": "2 A don't have to"}, {"h": 0.009588087620718064, "x": 0.7118